@startuml
title Cycle 4 - Pipeline audio logiciel Raspberry

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
left to right direction

rectangle "Voix utilisateur" as VOICE #FFFFFF
rectangle "ReSpeaker 4-Mic\nUSB" as MIC #E8F4FF
rectangle "Flux PCM\narecord" as PCM #F3F8EE
rectangle "Vosk Wake Word\nlocal" as VOSK #FFF8E1
rectangle "VAD sox\nquestion complete" as VAD #FFF8E1
rectangle "WAV question" as WAV #F3F8EE
rectangle "Backend FastAPI\nSTT + n8n + TTS" as BACKEND #FDEDEC
rectangle "ActionResult\nJSON + audio_b64" as RESULT #F4ECF7
rectangle "AudioOutputAdapter\npaplay / Bluetooth" as OUT #E8F4FF
rectangle "Reponse vocale" as REPLY #FFFFFF

VOICE --> MIC
MIC --> PCM
PCM --> VOSK : mode passif
VOSK --> VAD : mot reveil
VAD --> WAV : silence detecte
WAV --> BACKEND : POST multipart
BACKEND --> RESULT
RESULT --> OUT : audio WAV
OUT --> REPLY

note bottom of VOSK
  Tant que le mot reveil n'est pas detecte,
  aucun appel STT cloud n'est necessaire.
end note

@enduml
